* fix(treasury): decouple on-chain read client from payment activation (Treasury --)

Port of operator #1843. ViemEvmOnchainClient.getClient() — behind every on-chain read
(treasury balance, getBlockNumber, getLogs) — required getPaymentConfig() non-null,
throwing "Payment rails not activated" for any non-payment-activated node. A balance
read is a public chain read: it needs chain identity + RPC, not the operator wallet/Split.
Source chain from cogni_dao.chain_id (getDaoConfig). Fixes fleet-wide Treasury "--".

* fix(treasury): gate#2 — snapshot reads DAO identity, not payment activation

Second getPaymentConfig() gate (treasury adapter) joined gate#1 (client).
Proven live on beacon-test: blockNumber:0/[] -> 47814334/[USDC] (real Base read).

---------

