 to node-template (#63)

Adapts the operator's /observability finish-pass for the flat single-node
layout (app/src/**): drops operator-only sections (scheduler-worker,
services/, Python infra) and points at the node's own event registry
(app/src/shared/observability EVENT_NAMES + @cogni/node-shared) and the
/logs proxy. Keeps multi-node identity, privacy, and self-check rules.

Propagates to all forks via the operator Tier-2 fork sync.

